// route-planner/strings.js - UI strings of Route Planner (plan and trip-sheet pages) in the 7 UI languages.
// Structure: one flat object per language (key -> string, or a plural object { one, few, many, other } resolved by
// Intl.PluralRules in ui/i18n.js); {name} placeholders are filled by t(key, vars). Keys are namespaced 'rp.' so they
// cannot collide with other apps or shared ui keys in the global dictionary. English is the complete reference: a key
// missing in another language falls back to it (ui/i18n.js chain). Imported for its side effect by common.js.
